Package: yaf
Title: Yandex Direct API Functions
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Artem", "Rogozhin", , "tem19@live.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions for the Yandex Direct API v5 and the Wordstat API:
    statistics reports, campaigns, ad groups, ads, keywords, bid modifiers,
    negative keyword sets, regions, change tracking and a strategy learning
    check. Handles OAuth tokens, batching, pagination and retries.
